        <mxCell id="aux-note-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=13;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Auxiliary services: CloudWatch Logs keeps the function logs for 14 days. The IAM execution role lets Lambda read and write only the links table and write only to its own log group.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
